==Battleground==
*20 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*10 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 18.67 seconds<sup>560f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore]] spawns after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore]] spawns after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Generic anti-Red counters like [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Sorceress Cat]], [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Sword Master Cat]] and/or [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] can completely stop each Bore dead in their tracks. At that point, Area Attackers like [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] can have free reign over everything, so long as you kill the Aku Doges quickly enough.

